{"unit_id":"SA1992X__dsh-ctrl-enter-submit#card-zh","repo":"SA1992X/dsh-ctrl-enter-submit","commit":"a5eb1c312eb5cf5bbb4283ad4c650107d7b1c89a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ctrl-enter-submit 是面向 DSH Web 的键盘提交快捷键插件：它在浏览器客户端捕获输入事件，让主对话框和 Agent 提问卡片中的普通 Enter 用于换行或不触发选项，Ctrl/Cmd+Enter 则交给 DSH 提交或继续。它区分 textarea、contenteditable、单行输入和选项按钮，并在输入法组合或触发菜单打开时保留原行为。适合希望避免误提交、习惯多行输入的 DSH Web 用户；无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:147-200","client.js:209-224"]}
{"unit_id":"SA1992X__dsh-ctrl-enter-submit#card-en","repo":"SA1992X/dsh-ctrl-enter-submit","commit":"a5eb1c312eb5cf5bbb4283ad4c650107d7b1c89a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ctrl-enter-submit is a DSH Web keyboard plugin: Enter adds a newline in the composer and Ctrl/Cmd+Enter submits. In agent question cards, Enter does not submit single-line answers or activate choices. It leaves menus and IME input untouched. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:147-200","client.js:209-224"]}
