{"unit_id":"SA1992X__dsh-ctrl-enter-submit#feature-1","repo":"SA1992X/dsh-ctrl-enter-submit","commit":"a5eb1c312eb5cf5bbb4283ad4c650107d7b1c89a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「Enter 换行、组合键提交」：主对话框 textarea 中普通 Enter 保留原生换行；contenteditable 中尝试走 Shift+Enter 换行路径。Ctrl/Cmd+Enter 放行给 DSH 处理提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:147-177"]}
{"unit_id":"SA1992X__dsh-ctrl-enter-submit#feature-2","repo":"SA1992X/dsh-ctrl-enter-submit","commit":"a5eb1c312eb5cf5bbb4283ad4c650107d7b1c89a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「提问卡片快捷键」：Agent 提问卡片里的多行 textarea 按普通 Enter 换行；单行答案框按普通 Enter 不提交，Ctrl/Cmd+Enter 继续交给 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:179-200"]}
{"unit_id":"SA1992X__dsh-ctrl-enter-submit#feature-3","repo":"SA1992X/dsh-ctrl-enter-submit","commit":"a5eb1c312eb5cf5bbb4283ad4c650107d7b1c89a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「避免选项误触」：提问卡片的 radio 或 checkbox 按钮遇普通 Enter 时阻止默认激活和后续处理；鼠标或空格操作不由该处理分支拦截。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:188-194"]}
{"unit_id":"SA1992X__dsh-ctrl-enter-submit#feature-4","repo":"SA1992X/dsh-ctrl-enter-submit","commit":"a5eb1c312eb5cf5bbb4283ad4c650107d7b1c89a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「保留输入菜单和输入法行为」：当 composer 的触发菜单可见，或浏览器处于输入法组合状态时，插件不接管普通 Enter。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:147-165"]}
